    "media:imagetext": "T.D. 1\nCANADIAN PACIFIC TELEGRAPHS ..1\nCANADIAN\nPACIFIC\nThis is a full-rate Telegram\nDIRECT COMMUNICATION WITH\ngram\nunless\nor Cable-\notherwise\nindicated by\nsignal in the check or in the address.\nTHE INTERNATIONAL SYSTEM -\nDL\nDAY LETTER\nIMPERIAL AND INTERNATIONAL\nCOMMUNICATIONS\nNL\nNIGHT LETTER\nPOSTAL TELEGRAPH\n- MACKAY RADIO\nCOMMUNICATIONS LIMITED -\nNM\nNIGHT TELEGRAM\nLCO\nDEFERRED\nCOMMERCIAL CABLES - ALL AMERICA CABLES\nIMPERIAL CABLES - BRITISH PACIFIC CABLE\nNLT\nCABLE LETTER\nWLT\nWEEK END LETTER\nMONEY TRANSFERRED BY TELEGRAPH\nHALIFAX AND BERMUDA CABLE CO.\nEAA202 48 NL\nSTANDARD TIME\nW. D. NEIL, GENERAL MANAGER OF\nCOMMUNICATIONS, MONTREAL.\n935\nJAN 26\nDM\n8\n00\nHO SILOUIS MO 26\nHM BIXBY\nSTEAMER EMPRESS OF ASIA SAILING LATE FRIDAY NIGHT OR SATURDAY\nVANCOUVER BC\nHAVE SIGNED CONTRACT AND CHECK BILL MEDART FOR SIX THOUSAND\nCOVERING SOUTH IWO ACRES STOP IF SATISFACIORY WILL DEDUCT TAXES\nBACK INTEREST AND NOTE DUE MARCH APPLY BALANCE ON FIRST MORTGAGE\nSTOP IF I DONT HEAR FROM YOU WILL MAKE SALE AS OUTLINED STOP GOOD\nLUCK TO YOU\n605\nRALPH.",
